[CENTER][SIZE=6][B]Expressive Launcher 3.0.9 (Build 41) — Pro Activation & Licensing Polish[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][I]Resilient PayPal Verification, Offline Key Fallback & 1-Tap Support Flow[/I][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[HR][/HR]

Hey everyone!

Following up quickly on feedback regarding PayPal transaction verification in the app, we are releasing [B]Version 3.0.9 (Build 41)[/B]! This update focuses on resolving activation errors and ensuring every supporter has a completely frictionless, guaranteed path to unlocking Expressive Pro.

[SIZE=5][B]✨ What's New in 3.0.9 (Build 41)[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Resilient PayPal Verification & Offline Fallback:[/B] Addressed network connection errors when verifying PayPal Transaction IDs. Rather than displaying technical connection exceptions, the dialog now provides graceful offline assistance.
[*][B]1-Tap Email Support for Pro Keys:[/B] If automated activation is undergoing maintenance, you can now tap the new [B]"Email Support for Pro Key"[/B] button directly in the dialog. It launches your email client pre-populated with your Device ID and Transaction ID addressed to [EMAIL]daryldenson0405@gmail.com[/EMAIL] so an offline key can be issued immediately.
[*][B]One-Tap "Copy Details":[/B] Added a quick-copy button that puts your Device ID and transaction details on your clipboard, making it effortless to paste them in an XDA PM or on Telegram.
[*][B]Smart Input Detection:[/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]PayPal Button ID Guard:[/B] If you accidentally enter the donation link button ID ([ICODE]9RB3TYYQ6FWE2[/ICODE]), the launcher recognizes it and explains that it is the button ID rather than your personal 17-character receipt ID.
[*][B]License Key Auto-Redeem:[/B] If an offline license key ([ICODE]EXPR-PRO-...[/ICODE]) is pasted into the transaction field, the launcher automatically detects and activates it directly.
[/LIST]
[*][B]Updated Placeholder Hint:[/B] Clarified the input placeholder to guide users toward their 17-character receipt ID (e.g. [ICODE]5Y6345678A1234567[/ICODE]).
[*][B]Always-Visible Support Card:[/B] Added a permanent support card at the bottom of the *Donate & Unlock* tab.
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]🔑 Already Contributed and Need Your Offline Key?[/B][/SIZE]
If you contributed via PayPal and received a connection error:
[LIST=1]
[*]Open the launcher settings &gt; [B]Expressive Pro[/B] &gt; [B]Donate &amp; Unlock[/B].
[*]Copy your [B]Device ID[/B] (e.g. [ICODE]DEV-XXXX-XXXX[/ICODE]).
[*]PM me here on XDA or email [B][EMAIL]daryldenson0405@gmail.com[/EMAIL][/B] with your Device ID and PayPal transaction ID.
[*]You will receive your offline ECDSA P-256 license key ([ICODE]EXPR-PRO-...[/ICODE]) immediately!
[*]Paste the key into the [B]Offline Key[/B] tab in the dialog and Pro features unlock instantly with 100% offline cryptographic verification.
[/LIST]

